are you ready to learn a bunch of  secrets and easter eggs about aaron  jaeger that you probably didn't know of  course you are let's get started aaron  ranks second in the first character  popularity poll right after levi  ackerman as we all know aaron is a  really energetic character this is why  isayama chose to give him black hair so  that it would be easier to draw speed  lines around him when he is moving we  usually get to see only one titan form  for each character but when it comes to  aaron we got to see a total of seven  different forms this includes pure titan  form incomplete titan failed titan  attack titan attack plus warhammer titan  founding titan and colossal titan in the  past isayama stated that he struggled to  make aaron feel alive when writing this  is why he called him a slave to the  story because of this isayama stated  that he didn't expect aaron to be  popular with readers however he also  said that aaron ranking second in the  character popularity pool really  surprised him aaron's titan form is  based on the japanese martial artist  yushinokami the creator of the attack on  titan also said that it is the ideal  physique of a middleweight mixed martial  artist aaron's fighting style is based  on a completely different fighter named  takanorigomi isayama used his southpaw  fighting style as a model for aaron the  name aaron is of turkish origin its  exact meaning and description are he who  progresses has reached towards divinity  maturity and sacred wisdom it can also  be interpreted as a saint or holy person  aaron could also stand for the german  word eri which means honor isayama has  stated that part of the reason he chose  the name aaron for the character is that  it sounds feminine which would make it  easier to remember aaron's surname  jaeger is an anglicized form of the  german surname jaeger meaning hunter  isayama said that he was skeptical about  the importance of bloodlines when coming  up with aaron this is why he made him  someone not blessed with natural talent  and the exact opposite of an ordinary  talented protagonist aaron's name is  believed to have come from his father's  compatriot aaron kruger he also uses his  last name kruger when he pretends to be  an injured soldier while infiltrating  marley isayama has stated he paid  particular attention to aaron's eyes  when designing him in order to make him  stand out from the rest of the cast in  addition he specifically chose to give  aaron thin eyebrows instead of thick  ones because he felt it would be  artificial to try to use thicker  eyebrows to accent aaron's angry  personality aaron has the highest titan  kill record by far out of all the former  graduates of the 104th training corps he  has killed only one titan in his human  form with the odm gear and around 22  with the help of his titan abilities  this makes his kill count around 23  although he probably killed many more  offscreen according to isayama if the  104th training court did have an arm  wrestling competition aaron would be  evenly matched with gene an interview  with isayama's editor back in 2013  revealed that isa yama originally  intended for aaron to know that he was a  titan from the very beginning however he  later scratched this idea since it would  make the show less interesting in the  online game age of gunslingers a special  titan mode was made to tribute the  series it features elm an npc modeled  after aaron and voiced by yuki kaji  there's also a special skin for the dual  pistol class available for purchase now  let's talk about a small detail that  almost everyone missed in this one scene  aaron was seen holding some kind of sign  if we zoom in a bit we can clearly see  that it says subscribe to jaegerists i  don't know why aaron would hold  something like that but it's probably  best that you do exactly what he tells  you you don't want to piss off aaron  towards the end of attack on titan aaron  grows out his hair when an interviewer  asked isayama why he did this he said  quote right now he is in a state where  he is no longer paying attention to how  people view him so he just lets it grow  out he should have kept a cleaner  hairstyle since he was supposed to be a  hospitalized patient referring to the  time aaron infiltrated marley okay this  fact is the most hilarious one yet the  titan forms of various attack on titan  characters were censored in malaysia the  titan forms of aaron as well as annie  and many more were seen wearing black  undergarments they literally put pants  on the titans after seeing this fans  started to make many memes and edit  themselves it's hilarious on a serious  note i got a very important question for  you guys if aaron's founding titan form  wore pants how would he wear them i'm  probably leaning towards this answer but  definitely tell me what you think in the  comments hajime isayama said that he  does not see aaron and armin as best  friends forever this proved true after  aaron accused armin of being controlled  by berthold and through their fight  after aaron declared he always hated  mikasa aaron learned something really  important from levi and no we're not  talking about military tactics levi  taught him how to clean according to  captain's expert judgment aaron was the  best at cleaning out of all the cadets  the attack on titan's unique ability to  see the future made aaron depressed  since he knows how horrifying the end  will be for everyone involved he loses  all hope additionally he's aware of the  divide between the eldians themselves  both of whom view others as enemies  instead of friends the story of the  attack on titan gets really dark as time  goes on so here's one small detail to  remember the good old times back in  episode 1 while carla and aaron were  talking carla immediately knew that  aaron was lying she knew this right away  because aaron's ears turn red whenever  he's lying in the 104th training court  aaron's nickname was actually the  suicide blockhead in season one of the  show when aaron was tasked with plugging  the hole in the wall rose he was seen  carrying a large boulder on his  shoulders this was inspired by the  ancient greek titan atlas he carried a  celestial sphere in his arms aaron's  birthday is on march 30th making him in  aries aaron is the character who gets in  trouble all the time throughout the  series so it shouldn't come as a shock  to learn that he was kidnapped a total  of three times on the show both aarons  and grisha's attack titans have pointy  ears however considering that aaron  krueger's attack titan does not have  this feature we can assume it's  something unique only to the jaeger  family aaron's height went from 170  centimeters to 183 centimeters in season  four making him one of the 104th  graduates that grew the most in height i  hope levi doesn't hear about this there  have been multiple inspirations that  hajime isayama has taken from various  mythical stories and folklores however  this has never been officially confirmed  by the creator himself there are a lot  of similarities between a protagonist  erin yeager and another popular  fictional character the character is  ericos from eternal champion eternal  champion is a 1970 novel by michael  morcock ericos and aaron start by  wanting to save the world yet end up  being its very enemy isayama stated in  an interview that because he and aaron  are polar opposites he had a hard time  writing the character until around the  fourth volume of the manga he also  claimed that he could not truly  understand aaron's character until he  heard yuki kaji's portrayal of him  during aaron's long battle against  annie's female titan aaron gets defeated  while annie makes her escape in order to  catch her aaron entered into so-called  berserk mode prompting veins in his  titan body to glow bright red giving him  extra strength and power he could easily  pin annie's titan down and defeat her  with his power well you're probably  wondering what is the fact here everyone  knew this already well the thing that  most people didn't know is that this  berserk mode is an exclusive anime scene  and never happened in the manga as a  matter of fact this whole fight played  out a little differently in the manga so  you definitely want to check that out if  you didn't know in the original attack  on titan manga aaron transforms into his  titan form under the stage of willy's  tiber festival he then throws him in the  air instantly splitting his body in half  this same scene was slightly different  in the anime because the creators  thought it was way too explicit also  during aaron's battle with warhammer  titan his titan gets decapitated and his  body is covered in smoke censoring it in  the manga things are very different and  there are way more explicit images in  the 2013 blog post isa yama revealed  that he had selected otoko hua romandase  takedakun as a character song for aaron  due to copyright reasons i'm not going  to play the song here but if you're  interested go and check it out click on  this video where we explain all the  founding titans in attack on titan why  are you still here click it

